# Service definitions: "class|AUTH_MODE" — see InterceptingFilter for the
# PUBLIC / CONSOLE / TENANT / TENANT_OR_CONSOLE auth-mode semantics.
/api/v1/setup=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Setup|PUBLIC
/api/v1/auth=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Auth|PUBLIC
/api/v1/users=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Users|CONSOLE
/api/v1/app=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.App|CONSOLE
/api/v1/accounts=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Accounts|TENANT_OR_CONSOLE
/api/v1/ledger=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Ledger|TENANT_OR_CONSOLE
/api/v1/audit=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Audit|TENANT_OR_CONSOLE
/api/v1/reports=org.tsicoop.ledger.service.v1.Reports|CONSOLE
